  "statement": "Count the number of triangles with positive area whose vertices are points whose \\((x, y)\\)-coordinates lie in the set \\(\\{(0,0),(0,1),(0,2),(1,0),(1,1),(1,2),(2,0),(2,1),(2,2)\\}\\).",
