      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-general-1-2002-p8.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "There are \\(\\binom{9}{3}=84\\) triples of points. 8 of them form degenerate triangles (the ones that lie on a line), so there are \\(84-8=76\\) nondegenerate triangles.",
